(352) 438-2416
1/2/2026 -  APPROVED/DENIED as noted


SCOPE:   SFR “KB1“ MODEL / CMU CONST. / 1 STORY
                4 BEDROOMS - 2 BATHS / COVERED LANAI
                2 CAR GARAGE - LEFT - FRONT LOADED


NOTE:  Sealing design professional license verified active


REVIEW COMMENTS:
1)  The Product Approval Specification Sheet did not include an approval number 
     for the off-ridge vents specified on Sheet A1.4.  Provide an approval number 
     for this product.  F.S. 553.842 and FAC 9N-J
2)  The Finished Floor to Exterior Grade dimension in Detail F1 and F2 on Sheet 
     S2.3 is cut off and illegible.  Revise plans to make the dimension legible.  
     FBC 107
3)  The details on Sheet S2.4 do not specify that the foundation footing be the 
     code required 12 inches below grade.  Revise drawings to include this
     specification.  FBC R403
4)  The details on Sheet S2.4 do not specify that the finished floor elevation be the
     required 8" above the exterior finished grade.  Revise drawing to include this 
     specification.  Marion County Code of Ordinances Chapter 5.5, Article II 
     Section 5.5.33(L)
5)  The plans did not include a valley flashing detail or specifications.  Revise 
      plans to include this information.   R905


ADVISORY NOTES:
1)  Residential Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing work to be field verified, 
     drawings not reviewed per Marion County policy and FBC 107.3.5
2)  Applicant, Builder and or Contractor shall provide and have available on site at 
     time of inspection, the installation specifications or guidelines for all exterior
     component and cladding elements either listed on a product approval form or
     depicted on the plans.'
